  _description: "Effect: Breakneck Rush maintains a consistent 95% Hit Chance regardless
    of distance traveled. However, Nikita no longer gains the Speed bonus after successfully
    landing the attack.\r\n\r\nExplanation: Sacrifices Nikita's ability to build
    Speed in exchange for consistent attack accuracy. Particularly useful against
    evasive bosses or when Nikita needs to reliably land attacks from a distance.
    \r\n"
